WEBVTT

00:07:56.963 --> 00:08:00.663
show in virtual galleries
and virtual worlds

00:08:00.663 --> 00:08:04.063
and sell 3D objects and clothes
to virtual humans.

00:08:05.530 --> 00:08:07.263
OK, so how does this work,

00:08:07.297 --> 00:08:09.330
and how do you get involved as an artist?

00:08:10.163 --> 00:08:12.230
Your artwork is a digital file.

00:08:13.130 --> 00:08:14.830
To protect this file

00:08:14.863 --> 00:08:18.630
and capture the value
of your labor in perpetuity,

00:08:18.663 --> 00:08:21.963
you go to a digital goods
marketplace and "mint" it,

00:08:21.963 --> 00:08:28.130
meaning you register your work as a token,
for a fee, on the blockchain.

00:08:29.163 --> 00:08:32.063
It will contain a signature, time stamp,